<title>USA: Styling Technology upped by Laifer group.</title>
<headline>Styling Technology upped by Laifer group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Laifer Capital Management Inc said Friday it raised its stake in Styling Technology Corp to 604,400 common shares or 15.3 percent from 10.7 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought shares March 26 and April 8 at $9.125 to $10.625 per share.</p>
<p>Styling, a perfumes and cosmetics firm, is based in Phoenix, Ariz.</p>
